# fixedbugs, defect 2556, lane b38-module, 2026-11-15.
#
# The package `rb` holds the package `qt`'s record by value, so its unit
# includes `qt.h` and searches `qt`'s folder after its own route (defect
# 2357); its own header asks `qt.h` for a file `qt` does not ship. The
# refusal named every place the unit looks but `qt`'s folder, and its note
# said such a unit never reads another package's files, while this one reads
# `qt.h` from there. Now the folder is named where the unit looks, and the
# note says it reads that package's files and where a header it needs ships.
use <rb>/sum

function main()
    print(sum.sum())
